Cross-referencing everything
Every labelled element can be referenced from the text, and the numbers update automatically each time you render:








Type
Where the label goes
Reference syntax




Figures
#| label: fig-name (code chunk) or {#fig-name} (image)
@fig-name


Tables
#| label: tbl-name or {#tbl-name}
@tbl-name


Equations
$$ ... $$ {#eq-name}
@eq-name


Sections
## Heading {#sec-name}
@sec-name



![Alt text](images/your_image.png){#fig-scaffold fig-align="center" width="70%"}

See @fig-scaffold and @sec-methods for details.
